  "id": "lava_visualization",
  "summary": "Visualizes volcanic lava flows from Sentinel-2 imagery using SWIR Band 12 thermal-emission thresholds, with continuous-intensity heatmap, binary red/yellow, and context-preserving rendering styles, plus optional cloud avoidance to reduce false detections.",
  "description": "Visualizes active volcanic lava flows from Sentinel-2 imagery using SWIR Band 12 thermal-emission thresholds blended into a base map that preserves soil, built-up areas, vegetation, and water bodies. Supports a continuous lava intensity heatmap, binary lava detection in red or yellow, and a context-preserving style that retains underlying land-cover information for situational awareness. Includes optional cloud avoidance logic to reduce false detections."
